---
layout: base.njk
title: Peach
description: "Live women's professional baseball on your Lock Screen and in the Dynamic Island."
permalink: /Peach/
# Set this to the App Store URL once the app is approved. While it is empty the
# page shows a "coming soon" note instead of a button that goes nowhere.
appStoreUrl: ""
---

<div class="app-detail">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <div class="app-detail-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <a href="{{ "/" | url }}" class="app-detail-back">← Cloudgate Studios</a>
      <div class="app-detail-hero-content">
        <div class="app-detail-icon-wrap">
          <img src="{{ "/assets/img/PeachIcon.png" | url }}" alt="Peach icon" width="120" height="120">
        </div>
        <div class="app-detail-hero-text">
          <h1 class="app-detail-title">Peach</h1>
          <p class="app-detail-tagline">Live women's pro baseball on your Lock Screen</p>
          {% if appStoreUrl %}
          <a href="{{ appStoreUrl }}" class="store-btn store-btn--large" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18.71 19.5c-.83 1.24-1.71 2.45-3.05 2.47-1.34.03-1.77-.79-3.29-.79-1.53 0-2 .77-3.27.82-1.31.05-2.3-1.32-3.14-2.53C4.25 17 2.94 12.45 4.7 9.39c.87-1.52 2.43-2.48 4.12-2.51 1.28-.02 2.5.87 3.29.87.78 0 2.26-1.07 3.8-.91.65.03 2.47.26 3.64 1.98-.09.06-2.17 1.28-2.15 3.81.03 3.02 2.65 4.03 2.68 4.04-.03.07-.42 1.44-1.38 2.83M13 3.5c.73-.83 1.94-1.46 2.94-1.5.13 1.17-.34 2.35-1.04 3.19-.69.85-1.83 1.51-2.95 1.42-.15-1.15.41-2.35 1.05-3.11z"/></svg>
            Download on the App Store
          </a>
          {% else %}
          <p class="app-detail-pending">Coming soon to the App Store</p>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Description -->
  <div class="app-detail-description">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="app-detail-description-inner">
        <div class="app-detail-screenshot">
          <img src="{{ "/assets/img/PeachScreenshot.jpg" | url }}" alt="A Peach Live Activity on the iPhone Lock Screen, showing the score, inning, count, and the current play" width="280">
        </div>
        <div class="app-detail-description-text">
          <h2>The score, without opening the app</h2>
          <p>Peach puts a live game on your Lock Screen and in the Dynamic Island. It appears at first pitch and updates itself — score, inning, count, and who is on base.</p>
          <p>Most nights there is no game on, so the rest of the app answers what you actually want to know in between: the next game, what happened last night, where your team stands, and who is leading the season.</p>
          {% if appStoreUrl %}
          <a href="{{ appStoreUrl }}" class="store-btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18.71 19.5c-.83 1.24-1.71 2.45-3.05 2.47-1.34.03-1.77-.79-3.29-.79-1.53 0-2 .77-3.27.82-1.31.05-2.3-1.32-3.14-2.53C4.25 17 2.94 12.45 4.7 9.39c.87-1.52 2.43-2.48 4.12-2.51 1.28-.02 2.5.87 3.29.87.78 0 2.26-1.07 3.8-.91.65.03 2.47.26 3.64 1.98-.09.06-2.17 1.28-2.15 3.81.03 3.02 2.65 4.03 2.68 4.04-.03.07-.42 1.44-1.38 2.83M13 3.5c.73-.83 1.94-1.46 2.94-1.5.13 1.17-.34 2.35-1.04 3.19-.69.85-1.83 1.51-2.95 1.42-.15-1.15.41-2.35 1.05-3.11z"/></svg>
            App Store
          </a>
          {% endif %}
          <p class="app-detail-disclaimer">Peach is unofficial. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by the Women's Pro Baseball League. Team names are used descriptively, and no league logos or marks appear in the app.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
